OL,3,GNEWSAStark differences in election
OL,4,Acampaign costs shown
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne successful Senator for Jersey spent
OL,7,Fabout #14,000 on his electoral
OL,8,Fcampaign, compared to another who
OL,9,Fdeclared nothing at all, an expenses
OL,10,Freport has revealed.
OL,12,FJersey's electoral authority released
OL,13,Fthe expenses of all candidates,
OL,14,Fsuccessful and not, from this year's
OL,15,Felection.
OL,17,FSenators could spend a maximum of
OL,18,F#15,172.21 for their campaigns, with
OL,19,Fconstable funds ranging from #2,708.10
OL,20,Fin St Mary to #6,490.97 in St Helier.
OL,21,FDeputies could spend between #3,706.11
OL,22,Fto #3,986.52.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
