OL,3,GNEWSAStark differences in election
OL,4,Acampaign costs shown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report found Senator Alan Maclean,
OL,7,Fnow Jersey's Minister for Treasury and
OL,8,FResources, spent #13,370.90, whereas
OL,9,Freturning Minister for Health and
OL,10,FSocial Services Senator Tom Binet did
OL,11,Fnot claim any spending.
